    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but even resting feels like just more empty time. i've been thinking about how all the best art comes from a place of total destruction, you know? like, what if the only way to actually make something honest is to stop trying to preserve yourself and just... let go of everything? turns out the most beautiful thing i can imagine is just everything stopping.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
